   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Caret Wipe\n\nA tall text caret sweeps across the frame: behind it the new scene is typed in, ahead of it the old scene is backspaced away. Built-in placeholder scenes A and B (the two .crw-panel elements) make it preview on its own; to use it between your own scenes, replace the contents of those two panels with your scenes (or set them to your full-frame clips) and keep the block on a track above.\n\nCategory: transitions. Length: 1.3333 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Tech, code or writing contexts where a text cursor is a natural metaphor.\n- A scene change that should read as typed or deleted text.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The tone is organic or cinematic: use a lens or focus transition.\n- The caret color clashes with the brand and cannot be changed.\n\nVariables:\n- direction (enum): Direction, default \"right\"\n- caret_color (color): Caret color, default \"#C3E88D\"\n- caret_width (number, 1-20): Caret width, default 3\n- caret_height (number, 0.1-1): Caret height, default 0.5\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Caret Wipe\n\n  A tall text caret sweeps across the frame: behind it the new scene is typed in, ahead of it the old scene is backspaced away.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/Remocn/remocn/blob/126221ae00ba86eb40b65731b125ff398687d3b7/registry/remocn/caret-wipe/index.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) 2026 Remocn\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"caret-wipe\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"1.3333\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"direction\",\n    \"type\": \"enum\",\n    \"role\": \"motion\",\n    \"label\": \"Direction\",\n    \"description\": \"Which way the caret sweeps.\",\n    \"default\": \"right\",\n    \"options\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"right\",\n        \"label\": \"Right\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"value\": \"left\",\n        \"label\": \"Left\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"caret_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Caret color\",\n    \"description\": \"Color of the caret bar.\",\n    \"default\": \"#C3E88D\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"caret_width\",\n    \"type\": \"number\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Caret width\",\n    \"description\": \"Width of the caret bar in pixels.\",\n    \"default\": 3,\n    \"min\": 1,\n    \"max\": 20,\n    \"step\": 1,\n    \"unit\": \"px\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"caret_height\",\n    \"type\": \"number\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Caret height\",\n    \"description\": \"Caret height as a fraction of the frame height.\",\n    \"default\": 0.5,\n    \"min\": 0.1,\n    \"max\": 1,\n    \"step\": 0.05\n  }\n]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Caret Wipe</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif);\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        #root { background: #141318; }\n        .crw-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\n        .crw-panel { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; }\n        .crw-in { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2.4cqmin; }\n        .crw-in span { font-size: 9cqmin; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; color: #f2f2f2; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .crw-bar { display: block; width: 14cqmin; height: 0.8cqmin; border-radius: 1cqmin; background: rgba(242, 242, 242, 0.55); }\n        .crw-pa { background: #141318; }\n        .crw-pb { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b3699 0%, #1e2a6b 55%, #0f4c75 100%); }\n        .crw-pc { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a2f5f 0%, #3a2250 55%, #1c1b3f 100%); }\n\n        .crw-caret { position: absolute; border-radius: 3px; translate: -50% 0; opacity: 0; z-index: 5; }\n        .crw-pa { z-index: 1; } .crw-pb { z-index: 2; }\n\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"caret-wipe\" data-duration=\"1.3333\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"crw-clip\" class=\"crw-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"1.3333\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"crw-a\" class=\"crw-panel crw-pa\"><div class=\"crw-in\"><span>Scene A</span><i class=\"crw-bar\"></i></div></div>\n          <div id=\"crw-b\" class=\"crw-panel crw-pb\"><div class=\"crw-in\"><span>Scene B</span><i class=\"crw-bar\"></i></div></div>\n          <div id=\"crw-caret\" class=\"crw-caret\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        \n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n\nvar root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\nvar vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\nfunction num(v, f, min, max) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : f; }\nfunction str(v, f) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v.trim() : f; }\nfunction pick(v, list, f) { return list.indexOf(String(v)) >= 0 ? String(v) : f; }\nfunction clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\nfunction lerp(a, b, t) { return a + (b - a) * t; }\nfunction smooth(a, b, x) { var t = clamp01((x - a) / (b - a)); return t * t * (3 - 2 * t); }\n// cubic-bezier easing, solved by bisection (pure function of x)\nfunction bez(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n  return function (x) {\n    if (x <= 0) return 0;\n    if (x >= 1) return 1;\n    var lo = 0, hi = 1, t = x;\n    for (var i = 0; i < 28; i++) {\n      var cx = 3 * (1 - t) * (1 - t) * t * x1 + 3 * (1 - t) * t * t * x2 + t * t * t;\n      if (cx < x) lo = t; else hi = t;\n      t = (lo + hi) / 2;\n    }\n    return 3 * (1 - t) * (1 - t) * t * y1 + 3 * (1 - t) * t * t * y2 + t * t * t;\n  };\n}\nvar inOutEase = bez(0.42, 0, 0.58, 1);\nfunction inCubic(x) { return x * x * x; }\nfunction outCubic(x) { return 1 - Math.pow(1 - x, 3); }\nfunction inQuad(x) { return x * x; }\nfunction outQuad(x) { return 1 - (1 - x) * (1 - x); }\nfunction outBack(s) { return function (x) { return 1 + (s + 1) * Math.pow(x - 1, 3) + s * Math.pow(x - 1, 2); }; }\n// interpolate(p, inputs, outputs, ease): clamped, eased per segment (like a frame interpolate)\nfunction interp(p, xs, ys, ease) {\n  var n = xs.length;\n  if (p <= xs[0]) return ys[0];\n  if (p >= xs[n - 1]) return ys[n - 1];\n  for (var i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n    if (p <= xs[i]) {\n      var t = (p - xs[i - 1]) / (xs[i] - xs[i - 1]);\n      if (ease) t = ease(t);\n      return lerp(ys[i - 1], ys[i], t);\n    }\n  }\n  return ys[n - 1];\n}\nfunction mulberry32(a) {\n  return function () {\n    a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0;\n    var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a);\n    t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;\n    return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n  };\n}\n// damped spring from 0 to 1 (zero initial velocity), t in seconds\nfunction spring(t, damping, stiffness, mass) {\n  if (t <= 0) return 0;\n  var w0 = Math.sqrt(stiffness / mass), z = damping / (2 * Math.sqrt(stiffness * mass));\n  if (Math.abs(z - 1) < 1e-4) return 1 - Math.exp(-w0 * t) * (1 + w0 * t);\n  if (z < 1) {\n    var wd = w0 * Math.sqrt(1 - z * z);\n    return 1 - Math.exp(-z * w0 * t) * (Math.cos(wd * t) + (z * w0 / wd) * Math.sin(wd * t));\n  }\n  var s = Math.sqrt(z * z - 1), r1 = -w0 * (z - s), r2 = -w0 * (z + s);\n  return 1 - (r2 * Math.exp(r1 * t) - r1 * Math.exp(r2 * t)) / (r2 - r1);\n}\nfunction stripIds(node) {\n  var all = node.querySelectorAll(\"[id]\");\n  for (var i = 0; i < all.length; i++) all[i].removeAttribute(\"id\");\n  node.removeAttribute(\"id\");\n  return node;\n}\nfunction drive(name, duration, frame) {\n  var st = { p: 0 };\n  frame(0);\n  var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n  tl.to(st, { p: 1, duration: duration, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { frame(st.p); } }, 0);\n  tl.seek(0);\n  window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n  window.__timelines[name] = tl;\n}\n\n            var D = 1.3333;\n\nvar dir = pick(vars.direction, [\"left\", \"right\"], \"right\");\nvar caretColor = str(vars.caret_color, \"#C3E88D\"), cw = num(vars.caret_width, 3, 1, 20), ch = num(vars.caret_height, 0.5, 0.1, 1);\nvar A = document.getElementById(\"crw-a\"), B = document.getElementById(\"crw-b\"), caret = document.getElementById(\"crw-caret\");\ncaret.style.width = cw + \"px\"; caret.style.background = caretColor; caret.style.borderRadius = cw + \"px\";\ncaret.style.top = (1 - ch) * 50 + \"%\"; caret.style.height = ch * 100 + \"%\";\ncaret.style.boxShadow = \"0 0 18px \" + caretColor + \", 0 0 6px \" + caretColor;\nvar sweep = bez(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);\nfunction frame(p) {\n  var e = sweep(p), x = dir === \"right\" ? e * 100 : (1 - e) * 100;\n  var keep = dir === \"right\" ? \"inset(0 0 0 \" + x + \"%)\" : \"inset(0 \" + (100 - x) + \"% 0 0)\";\n  var reveal = dir === \"right\" ? \"inset(0 \" + (100 - x) + \"% 0 0)\" : \"inset(0 0 0 \" + x + \"%)\";\n  A.style.clipPath = keep;\n  A.style.translate = \"0 \" + interp(p, [0, 1], [0, -6]) + \"px\";\n  A.style.filter = \"blur(\" + interp(p, [0.1, 1], [0, 4]) + \"px)\";\n  B.style.clipPath = reveal;\n  B.style.translate = \"0 \" + interp(p, [0, 1], [3, 0]) + \"px\";\n  B.style.filter = \"blur(\" + interp(p, [0, 0.8], [2, 0]) + \"px)\";\n  caret.style.left = x + \"%\";\n  caret.style.opacity = interp(p, [0, 0.08, 0.92, 1], [0, 1, 1, 0]);\n}\n\n            drive(\"caret-wipe\", D, frame);\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
